000BCCr 1               ; ball X leaves the paddle upwards, at an angle from A = where on the
000BCCr 1               ; paddle (0 .. pad_w - 1 from its left end, its middle pixel): the left
000BCCr 1               ; quarter steeply ... the left end flat to the left, the same to the right
000BCCr 1               bounce_from:
000BCCr 1  48                   pha
